<span id="S2.T2.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><img src="2605.07161v1/claude.png" id="S2.T2.m2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:14/14;" width="14" height="14" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span>
</span><span id="S2.T2.5.2.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> Sonnet-4.6</span></td>
