problem types. “Ported” refers to problems directly
ported from AIOpsLab/ITBench; “Similar Failures” are new
problems in <span id="S3.T4.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SREGym</span> that share failure patterns with “Ported”;
“New failures” are faults and failure modes unique to <span id="S3.T4.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SREGym</span>.</span></figcaption>
