<span id="A5.T8.7.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><img src="2605.07161v1/claude.png" id="A5.T8.m1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:14/14;" width="14" height="14" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span>
</span> Sonnet 4.6</span></td>
