<figure id="A5.T9" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span><span id="A5.T9.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">kubectl</span> read/write analysis.
Ratio is total reads divided by total writes.
“Reads <math id="A5.T9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> First Write” is the mean number of read-only
<span id="A5.T9.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">kubectl</span> commands before the first mutation
of system state,
averaged per problem then across problems.</figcaption>
